  </Configuration>
  <DocumentLink id="4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" target-id="SD:fcaad9da-6f4c-529d-b2cb-ca0620011e9f" type="Default" />
  <Item id="176690fc-b812-53dd-a690-881d94bf9215" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SWR-000</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+40%">Software safety requirements — PTO-ECU 200 (SRL 2)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>Per ISO 25119-3:2018, Clause 7. The required SRL derives from the AgPL d / Category 3 selection (25119-2 Figure 2 → SRL 2). Method selection from Tables 1–6 is recorded in §M at the end of this document; the software V-model phases and their work products are in the V&amp;V plan.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="SRL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>—</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Partition" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="c394d65f-2332-5bdb-b717-49f49c6d2381" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SWR-101</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Engage-sequence validator: accept an engage command only on the pattern collar-lift → press with both contacts agreeing (2-of-2) inside 50 ms; any other pattern shall be rejected and, if persistent &gt; 100 ms, raise DTC C1101.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="SRL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-001</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Partition" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="75237cf0-db60-5859-bef4-8b9ccd6578e2" target-id="SDI:a80c6cef-3adf-595f-8281-784a8e4d42e4" doc-link-id="CDL:4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="11b373d0-7e10-5404-b345-cd8fc9725208" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SWR-102</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>State machine SM-1 per the TSC figure: states OFF, ARMED, RAMP, ENGAGED, STOPPING, EXT-JOG, SAFE; single entry/exit per transition; unreachable states and transitions are statically excluded (model-checked).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="SRL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-005</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Partition" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="d046be54-7bc6-57e5-a248-dfc86bb16c48" target-id="SDI:9f0356ad-2358-57c1-9ccf-b82503570e8a" doc-link-id="CDL:4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="3753e270-679a-5a2c-b776-4071793e67dd" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SWR-103</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Engagement ramp controller: closed-loop valve-current ramp, table-driven (parameter set V7), duration ≤ 2.0 s, slip supervision with abort to STOPPING on stall/overcurrent.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="SRL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-011</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Partition" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="a044b876-92b2-57d3-ad1e-bc9a162ecc5c" target-id="SDI:61800c3b-3982-5bd6-8939-7630628420e6" doc-link-id="CDL:4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="a4f7aced-8271-5ae7-8847-ce673f8b2968" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SWR-104</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Stop processing: any stop source (switch, presence, monitor request, DTC) shall reach the output layer within 2 application cycles (20 ms cycle); stop has static priority over engage in the scheduler.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="SRL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-006</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Partition" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="56fce95f-e702-5c4b-8ec1-417ece645fec" target-id="SDI:8c3a15ac-daf4-5fbc-a5e4-47a593b66f96" doc-link-id="CDL:4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="46d523b9-a235-5eba-9bc6-6af438baeed9" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SWR-105</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Speed plausibility monitor: n_PTO vs mode nominal and vs n_ENG·ratio; windows and debounce per PTO-TSR-009/-010; runs in the diagnostics partition at 10 ms.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="SRL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-009, -010</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Partition" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="7c627e90-a1e5-58e8-8be4-b5f260c45be5" target-id="SDI:aae2fe37-86f4-5ba7-aa8b-57290747beb0" doc-link-id="CDL:4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" type="Default" />
    <ElementLink id="a73c0f16-ac35-5018-b4d2-226c117c2b41" target-id="SDI:86d1f2c8-08d9-5b12-83d7-2d86488f85b3" doc-link-id="CDL:4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="ba6ef0c1-1b88-501a-8220-621a65d85f4e" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SWR-106</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Valve-current window monitor (D1): command-dependent windows per PTO-TSR-003; both MCUs evaluate independently; disagreement of the two evaluations &gt; 50 ms is itself a fault (cross-check).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="SRL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-003</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Partition" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="868d5809-c529-550d-bac5-b68c22266cfe" target-id="SDI:60a9b0be-bfa7-5624-9762-ea7f98724c45" doc-link-id="CDL:4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="231194ae-dd79-5fac-ad3e-b18f61cde66e" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SWR-107</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Presence processing per PTO-TSR-007 with 1 s loss filter and stationary-mode gating; the stationary enable is a deliberate two-action input and is never persisted.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="SRL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-007</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Partition" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="8412a4c4-a6b4-5336-8689-af163024a645" target-id="SDI:f9fdda9c-5e66-5f5c-adb6-ae3f522fbc74" doc-link-id="CDL:4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="625d89e1-8ef7-51fe-8b40-182c92252bec" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SWR-108</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Start-up BIST: RAM march C-, flash CRC-32, register/ALU test, output pull-in test below clutch-fill (valve pulsed 10 ms, current must follow); outputs enabled only after PASS of both MCUs (PTO-TSR-004).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="SRL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-004</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Partition" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="9ab2ef8a-9970-5df1-9343-5134edfe9bfb" target-id="SDI:129f9ffb-f8e8-5d04-a420-dba1a4209c23" doc-link-id="CDL:4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="e5f6d4d9-51ec-5223-a3cf-0891d9ca6402" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SWR-109</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Watchdog service: L1 serves the external window WD (U6) from the 20 ms task only after a full alive-path check (control-flow monitoring with checkpoint sequence); L2 serves its internal WD likewise.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="SRL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-012</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Partition" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="89301b3b-9b19-57c3-aab5-5a990a51a932" target-id="SDI:77b5840b-9405-5352-b069-addb89043a46" doc-link-id="CDL:4ab1d26d-2b11-5ce4-b2ea-cedece9e964c" type="Default" />
  </Item>
</StructuredDocument>
